remarks = Array[String](["End of my shift. The crates can wait until tomorrow.", "Twelve hours on the hangar floor, and Nell still makes me pay for my drink.", "If you need a hand in the hangar, don't ask me today. Ask me tomorrow.", "The clamps holding your ship? I greased those myself. You're welcome.", "The best seat in the bar is right here, closest to the counter."])
